<https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/clr> a owl:Ontology , prof:Profile ;
    dct:title "Comprehensive Learner Record 2.0 — credential SHACL profile"@en ;
    dct:description "SHACL shapes for a 1EdTech Comprehensive Learner Record 2.0 — a W3C Verifiable Credential (VC Data Model 2.0) whose subject bundles achievement credentials. A profile of CLR 2.0: the shapes target 1EdTech's ClrCredential and ClrSubject classes and constrain the predicates the CLR 2.0, OB 3.0 and VC 2.0 JSON-LD contexts map a credential to, and each requirement is CLR 2.0's (its data model, Appendix B). The credentials a CLR bundles are Open Badges 3.0 credentials, which the Open Badges 3.0 profile checks. Registered as data — a second credential format needs no new engine."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Independent formalization by Mark Spivey (Foxxi Mediums Inc.). Not affiliated with or endorsed by 1EdTech or W3C. Where this document and the published standard differ, the standard governs."@en ,
        "Since 2026.10.0 the shapes target 1EdTech's ClrCredential and ClrSubject classes and the VC 2.0 predicates; the class and properties this document had minted for them are deprecated."@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/clr/2026.10.0> ;
    owl:versionInfo "2026.10.0" ;
    skos:historyNote "Versioned by calendar (YYYY.MM.PATCH) from 2026.10.0: the version numbers this document, not the standard it formalizes. Every released version stays resolvable at its version IRI, and the content there never changes. Earlier publications carried no version IRI, and their owl:versionInfo restated the version of the standard."@en ;
    dct:creator "Mark Spivey" ;
    dct:contributor "Claude (Anthropic)" ;
