    dct:bibliographicCitation "Spivey, M. (2026). Comprehensive Learner Record 2.0 — credential SHACL profile (Version 2026.10.0) [Ontology]. Foxxi Mediums Inc. https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/clr/2026.10.0" ;
